// # scripts/ — Sovereign Process Tools
//
// Logline: Re-opened for the 10/10 moonshot scorecard and the
//          CI-invoked governance verifiers the .github/release.yml
//          workflow depends on. Distinct from the .oo build runners
//          retired in 2026-09-02; these are read-only verifiers that
//          .github/workflows/ calls. Not a runner.
//
// Setup: RFC-0005 §4. Each file is a 4-element Academy header
//        .oo process tool, ≤ 256 lines, fail-closed. Re-exports
//        are explicit. qa/ remains the home of test code; scripts/
//        is the home of CI-invoked governance verifiers.
//
// Beats:
//   1. moonshot_scorecard.oot — the 8 moonshot lines scored 0-10, dated.
//   2. proof_of_today.oo     — the .oo driver that prints today's scorecard.
//   3. governance_*.oo        — the verifiers .github/release.yml calls.
//   4. redteam_orchestrate.oo — the 8-D Red Team polyrepo orchestrator.
//   5. Do not re-add build/test/release runners here; qa/ and .github/workflows/ own those.
